I suppose they could come after you even years later, basically whatever time the law in your state says you have to sue someone.  But from a practical standpoint I can't see them popping up more than 90 days later with an old assertion, it sort of makes them less believable if it gets to court.

&#x200B;

But storage is cheap, you can shove thousands of pictures up to the cloud for a few bucks so get some Google/Dropbox/Apple/whatever storage and don't sweat it.  Clean out your olds pictures once a year and call it done.  Like I said, if they want to haul you into court I'd wish them well claiming they just didn't get around to bothering to tell me I damaged their vehicle until long after any reasonable person would have discarded any evidence to the contrary.

Did you read the post?

>So she has stated in the last few weeks that she is bisexual. With that being said, 30% of the reason she wants to separate is to find out what her sexual needs are,

&#x200B;

I get what you're saying. I'll probably shoot a message or something next week. If she doesn't respond then, I'm done. 

&#x200B;

Part that sucks is that I might've lost a decent friend for some stupidass reason.

It's all about context to me. If he's worried about randos that you will encounter randomly from playing the game, that's way too touchy. If you're surrounding yourself (in the game) with a bunch of dudes that worship you and compete for you(explicitly or not) and constantly hit on you, that's different.

&#x200B;

It's like being hot and going to the gym. If you tell your BF not to go work out at all because he'll probably get hit on just for being attractive, that's not fair to him. You have to be able to trust him. If you don't want him to go because these 3 specific bitches are just going to fawn on him at this specific gym while he sporadically and lightly rebuffs them but not enough to actually tell them to fuck off so that it stops, then that's different because it's not really about working out anymore at all.

&#x200B;

There's a difference between encountering thirsty dudes and building relationships with them.
